ating latency and maximizing throughput globally.\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Global Compute.; Telemetry Engine.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FFFFFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Platform Architecture</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-400 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-zinc-800 selection:text-zinc-100 relative min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n\n    <!-- Background Grid & Vertical Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n        <!-- Subtle Grid Pattern -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.04]\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, #ffffff 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 4rem 4rem;\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Vertical Alignment Lines -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full border-x border-white/5 flex\">\n            <div class=\"flex-1 border-r border-white/5\"></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 border-r border-white/5 hidden md:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 border-r border-white/5 hidden lg:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1 hidden md:block\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Content Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full min-h-screen flex flex-col\">\n\n        <!-- Top Navigation / Header -->\n        <header class=\"border-b border-white/5 px-6 py-8 flex justify-between items-center bg-zinc-950/50 backdrop-blur-sm\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-xl text-zinc-100\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-normal tracking-widest text-zinc-100 uppercase\">Core Infrastructure</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"h-px w-8 bg-white/10 hidden sm:block\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500\">SYS.REQ.001</span>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Layout -->\n        <main class=\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12\">\n\n            <!-- Left Column: Architecture Intro -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-white/5 p-6 lg:p-12 xl:p-16 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                <div>\n                    <!-- Section Number -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-12\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 border border-white/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full\">01</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-widest\">Topology</span>\n                        <div class=\"h-px bg-white/10 flex-1\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-light tracking-tight text-zinc-100 leading-none mb-8\">\n                        Global<br>\n                        <span class=\"text-zinc-600\">Compute.</span>\n                    </h1>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-sm lg:text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-zinc-400 max-w-md\">\n                        Deploy your workloads across a highly distributed edge network. Our architecture ensures your services run closest to your users, eliminating latency and maximizing throughput globally.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Metrics Grid -->\n                <div class=\"mt-24\">\n                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 border-t border-white/5 pt-8\">\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-2 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest\">Latency Target</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl font-light tracking-tight text-zinc-100\">&lt;10ms</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div>\n                            <div class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 mb-2 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest\">Availability</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-3xl font-light tracking-tight text-zinc-100\">99.99%</div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Column: Visuals & Telemetry -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 p-6 lg:p-12 xl:p-16 flex flex-col justify-between relative overflow-hidden group bg-zinc-950/50\">\n\n                <!-- Section Number -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-12 justify-end\">\n                    <div class=\"h-px bg-white/10 w-16 md:w-32\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-widest\">Processing</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500 border border-white/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full\">02</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Technical Illustration Container -->\n                <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-square md:aspect-video lg:aspect-square max-h-[480px] border border-white/5 bg-zinc-900/10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center mb-16\">\n                    <!-- Corner Crosshairs -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-white/20\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-white/20\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-white/20\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-white/20\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Abstract Isometric SVG -->\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-full opacity-70 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105\">\n                        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"w-full h-full text-zinc-500\">\n                            <g transform=\"translate(100, 120)\">\n                                <!-- Background Grid inside SVG -->\n                                <line x1=\"-50\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"80\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"0.2\"/>\n                                <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"-80\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"200\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" opacity=\"0.2\"/>\n\n                                <!-- Base Layer -->\n                                <path d=\"M100 120 L200 70 L100 20 L0 70 Z\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\" class=\"text-zinc-400\"/>\n                                <path d=\"M0 70 L0 120 L100 170 L100 120\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\" class=\"text-zinc-500\"/>\n                                <path d=\"M200 70 L200 120 L100 170\" class=\"text-zinc-600\"/>\n\n                                <!-- Floating Processing Layer -->\n                                <g transform=\"translate(0, -70)\" class=\"animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 4s;\">\n                                    <path d=\"M100 120 L200 70 L100 20 L0 70 Z\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.04)\" class=\"text-zinc-200\"/>\n                                    <path d=\"M0 70 L0 120 L100 170 L100 120\" class=\"text-zinc-400\"/>\n                                    <path d=\"M200 70 L200 120 L100 170\" class=\"text-zinc-500\"/>\n\n                                    <!-- Connection Lines -->\n                                    <line x1=\"100\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"240\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" class=\"text-zinc-600\"/>\n                                    <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"190\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" class=\"text-zinc-600\"/>\n                                    <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"190\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" class=\"text-zinc-600\"/>\n                                </g>\n\n                                <!-- Active Nodes -->\n                                <circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"-50\" r=\"3\" class=\"text-zinc-100\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3\" class=\"text-zinc-100\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"200\" cy=\"0\" r=\"3\" class=\"text-zinc-100\" fill=\"currentColor\"/>\n                            </g>\n                        </svg>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Content & Action -->\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-8\">\n                    <div class=\"max-w-sm\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-light tracking-tight text-zinc-100 mb-4\">\n                            Telemetry Engine\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-sm font-light leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">\n                            Ingest, process, and analyze millions of events per second. Transform raw infrastructure data into actionable signals instantly.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs font-normal tracking-widest text-zinc-100 uppercase hover:text-white transition-colors border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-6 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 w-full lg:w-auto shrink-0\">\n                        <span>View Documentation</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n\n        <!-- Footer / Status Bar -->\n        <footer class=\"border-t border-white/5 px-6 py-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 bg-zinc-950/80 backdrop-blur-md\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500\">\n                <span class=\"border border-white/10 px-2 py-1 rounded-full\">03</span>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/60 animate-pulse\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"uppercase tracking-widest\">All Systems Operational</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600 uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                <span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Region: Global</span>\n                <span>v2.4.0</span>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "platform-architecture-2.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/platform-architecture-2.jpg", "source_name": "platform-architecture-2-DESIGN.md", "views": 121, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T06:26:07.475047+00:00"}